What:           /sys/bus/spi/devices/.../gesture_state
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        Doctor Logix <doctor.logix@gmail.com>
Description:
                Read-only mode and event counters for an S3910 following a DRM
                panel. gesture=1 means the volatile wakeup-gesture, double-tap
                mask and touch-hold settings were written and read back.
                reporting=0 indicates setup/recovery or a mode failure.
                Event counters include only firmware-decoded double taps and
                FOD contacts; no coordinates or biometric data are exposed.
                power/wakeup uses the standard device wakeup ABI. The state
                reports system wake retention separately from display-off.
